Instructions to build and install VIAFSB
========================================

You will need the DJGPP compiler and UNIX fileutils to build VIAFSB. 

DJGPP for DOS can be obtained from https://www.delorie.com/djgpp/.

You can alternatively use the DJGPP cross-compiler for Windows, Linux or Mac from https://github.com/andrewwutw/build-djgpp. On Windows, you would additionally need a UNIX shell like MSYS or MSYS2, or if you really must, CYGWIN. 

Building VIAFSB
---------------

VIAFSB uses GNU Makefiles.

1. To build VIAFSB, from the project directory run:

make all

2. To do a clean build, from the project directory run:

make clean all

After compilation you will find the VIAFSB executable in the project directory.

3. To cross-compile, pass the cross-compiler as an argument to make:

make CROSS_COMPILER=i586-pc-msdosdjgpp- clean all 
 


